BotStatus.description:
What the bot itself reports (never what the CMS tried to send), and what the CMS knows beside it.
`Has`, `Held` and `InUse` are the bot's answer and are empty unless `Reach` is `Answered`;
`LastKnown` is the number it reported the last time it answered, at `LastKnownAt`.

DeclarationStatus.description:
What a bot last declared and what this look at it came to. `Declaration` and `AnsweredAt` are the last good answer;
`Reason` says why the bot gave none now; `Mistakes` lists what is wrong with a refused answer;
`FormatFix` says what to do about a format version this CMS does not read; `CannotRun` lists what of the working state does not fit the declaration: steps using a block it leaves out, and actions it no longer has, describes differently or also holds as a code action.
